angelog entries added here): rustc\ncache fixes when another checkout already published a key; build-script\n`OUT_DIR` collection and reuse; Windows ConPTY cursor handling so builds\nstart; C shim no longer recurses when `ccache` is on `PATH`.\n**`mbx-cache-rustc` 0.20.2** also documents PGO compile reuse and\ncaching for `-C linker-flavor` rlibs/checks.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit\n0663751ca7004fb815e869dc6884170a7d287647. Bugbot is set up for automated\ncode reviews on this repo. Configure\n[here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a416015df0ce5db6fc05b41e20de65f75f0915d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mr-boxington/git/trees/9a416015df0ce5db6fc05b41e20de65f75f0915d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mr-boxington/git/commits/ebb2b61b193d9ea487b67152d459e8332e8cf87e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq0foWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqgsQAEGb5tB3b4YWiaOxvWAQFMo2\noKC97+INzXfj8oXj2D89gEvLAA73ltlQz6TUI+lSGWluap/fNjlParPoDXtdxoo9\nmsvyC0m6pZ1oVv7vNmsKOM9Fd1n8fIJFWM+tfYpxKyT1DoVfb3/hoo3O6diOmIr9\n1j8hQ1jG5cLX88wTCJMGgT7mTMbt8JspH8M/laty4jpaLs7HosTVZOuIqaTRjKVd\nhgnt4mmhmEYkNeY0IHZmXvCxP3T3Jnl0IYBt4whUpNXAUZlSqy3nlIUswdnz/ccY\nYBZC/PyqFroEBLVQA9I5WPs0S9DuXn/H+88rSzhIjlCUe2AvZ4dpZE715YTquyIz\nAjViEqgkTHh+/KN6KMy/kQTzC0cxWKPaWmBTFbGF5xKhCfQq2qBcFblC2yEGdSxp\nfALICcVVukCSwQ2XgaETl5BboY6Bi3Svr0HuipXwiLdr24uVZlBK8NIDXLZqOKJ1\nasm5Gyz+nwttSDj26+0IdMG5Hdefry4Fis19c7w5177oavbVUyMNDTFeyNhOypA5\nlPNPL2racRrwIwElnfE1l58WgrsfwmWl124YPV7gDoWKxYr9kdMwBlJBM2OzydzD\nBjNcdUW9GCH3C9nhY1syx7xo4rsSQV9urngyXIW+s0Cez3uA+af+rGOn0qZvVaat\n89Fs4MR+qkhojhdSy6Zk\n=6bTi\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 9a416015df0ce5db6fc05b41e20de65f75f0915d\nparent b7aabce346c619a348d9d7c9403d